      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIFE'S A JOURNEY (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (20.14) at this track behind Adhana Annie in a Other. Stalked the pace but found the line strongly. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from eight starts. Must come into calculations. JIMMY DEWALT (1) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fifth (23.52) at Gawler latest. Worth another chance. ZING MATILDA (4) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (20.52) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break off the middle. Can hit the frame this time. JUST ZORRO (8) hit the frame here last start and can sneak into the finish again.",
